sequenceDiagram
  %% status: draft
  %% command: process:logs
  %% kind: process.logs
  autonumber
  participant CLI as CLI / web / MCP
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant A as Node observer
  participant R as Reverb
  CLI->>GW: process:logs <process>
  Note over GW: Authorize and read bounded journal or container log
  GW-->>CLI: Snapshot and request ID
  opt --follow (CLI or web viewer)
    CLI->>GW: Open log stream with socket ID and line limit
    Note over GW: Validate source and grant access<br/>Store inactive viewer lease
    GW-->>CLI: Private channel and subscription signature
    CLI->>R: Subscribe to private log channel
    CLI->>GW: Renew lease after subscription succeeds
    GW->>A: log-streams.changed
    A->>GW: Fetch active stream sources
    loop new lines while lease is active
      A->>R: Read-only log observations
      R->>GW: Log batch
      Note over GW: Redact and preserve sequence and loss markers
      GW->>R: Viewer log.lines frames
      R-->>CLI: New lines
      CLI->>GW: Renew lease every 20 seconds
    end
    Note over CLI: Reconnect reopens the stream<br/>Bounded reads only while live path is unavailable
    CLI->>GW: Close lease on Ctrl-C or page exit
  end
